### Key Fixes Applied:
1. Fixed VM bytecode reading (kyInstr struct vs int array alignment)
2. Fixed JMPIF/JMPIFNOT jump offsets
3. Fixed binop opcode offsets (+ -> OP_ADD=6, etc.)
